  {
   "key": "narrator.intro",
   "file": "narrator-intro.mp3",
   "text": "Welcome to the island, explorer! This whole world is Sachayanthan's portfolio. Walk or drive to the glowing pads around the fountain to discover his story, his projects and his skills. Up north is Market Street, full of food stalls and shops, where you can even work a shift. To the south is the village, there are tent camps to the east and west, and the sports ground waits in the north-east. Catch the sunrise and sunset points on the beach. And one more thing... somewhere on this island hides a secret cave. Only one percent of explorers ever find it. Good luck!",
   "kind": "narrator",
   "who": "narrator intro",
